0..77 Comment "// A shared view kept in a capability scope\'s region: it lives as long as the"
78..155 Comment "// scope rather than the access that lent it, and the held value stays frozen"
156..233 Comment "// until the scope ends. A region is a static extent, ordered by outlives and"
234..311 Comment "// erased before anything runs: a value enters a region at any time and never"
312..385 Comment "// leaves it. Lifetimes stated by control rather than by a reference type"
386..437 Comment "// follow boats, \"References are like jumps\" (2024,"
438..515 Comment "// https://without.boats/blog/references-are-like-jumps/); regions as ordered"
516..591 Comment "// extents follow Koronkevich and Bowman, _Type Universes as Kripke Worlds_"
592..628 Comment "// (ICFP 2025, doi:10.1145/3747532)."
630..706 Comment "/// A thunk kept in the scope\'s region reads the held value through a shared"
707..762 Comment "/// view after the access that lent the view has ended."
